# Prototype Design System Rules

## Tech Stack

- **Next.js** App Router
- **Mantine v9** for UI and styling
- **TypeScript**

## Styling

- Style only with Mantine system props (`bg`, `c`, `w`, `h`, `p`, `px`, `py`, `m`, `mx`, `my`, `radius`, `shadow`, etc.)
- Do **not** use Tailwind CSS, CSS modules, or inline `style` props

## Design System Components

**Always import shared DS components from the kit**, never from `@mantine/core` and never from a local `components/DesignSystem` copy.

```tsx
import { Button, TextInput, Alert, Stack } from '@appdirect/ds-prototype-kit';
```

Product-specific widgets belong in `@/components/cbp`. Do not vendor or edit kit source in this repo.

## Data Tables

Use `DataTable` from `@appdirect/ds-prototype-kit` for sortable, filterable, paginated data. Use `Table` only for simple static markup.

## Page Headers

Use `PageContentHeader` from `@appdirect/ds-prototype-kit`.

## Kit updates

Bump `@appdirect/ds-prototype-kit` in `package.json` to a newer GitHub Release tarball URL when a new kit version ships. Do not cherry-pick from `appdirect-design-system`.
